{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Maintain direct-to-schools PE & sports premium funding",
        "additional_details": "We believe the Government\u2019s plans to end the direct-to-schools PE & sports premium\u2019 will damage the wrap around provision schools provide for children and deprive them of expert and professionally run PE lessons in school. We want the Government to prioritise children and their time away from screens by protecting this valuable social opportunity, which the direct premium provides for them, at a time when it is needed most.",
        "background": "We want the Government to maintain the current system of direct-to-schools PE & sports premium funding.",
